From 2ed6761337f9ee89b63129a9902564ee2c765991 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rnsbox <rnsbox@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:28:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] buildroot: enable python unicodedata on the 64bit configs
 (fixes rnsd dying at boot)

cvitek_SG200X_64bit_defconfig and cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig
carried BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_UNICODEDATA unset -> buildroot configured
CPython with --disable-unicodedata and the target had no
lib-dynload/unicodedata C extension. encodings.idna imports
"from unicodedata import ucd_3_2_0" at codec-load time, so EVERY
socket.getaddrinfo() on the board raised
LookupError: unknown encoding: idna.

rnsd creates its TCPServerInterface (listen_ip = 0.0.0.0, shipped by
default) at startup -> the LookupError escapes Reticulum as an
unhandled exception -> RNS exits without flushing anything: wanwatch
re-kicks it every 10 s, it dies again inside ~10 s
(/var/log/rnsd.log stays 0 bytes - os._exit, no traceback), and after
down_limit=3600 s wanwatch reboots the board. Observed as "rnsd dies
silently within 1-10 s" + an hourly reboot cycle.

Reproduced live over SSH: getaddrinfo fails the same way for admin;
with a stub unicodedata on PYTHONPATH the idna codec loads and
getaddrinfo succeeds. The 32bit defconfig already set this knob - the
64bit ones simply never did.

Cost: ~1.1 MB rootfs (the UCD tables in lib-dynload).
---
 buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_64bit_defconfig        | 2 +-
 buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_64bit_defconfig b/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_64bit_defconfig
index 429cb9b51..5f7a4bd9b 100644
--- a/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_64bit_defconfig
+++ b/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_64bit_defconfig
@@ -1309,7 +1309,7 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_BZIP2=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_OSSAUDIODEV is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_READLINE is not set
 BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_SSL=y
-# BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_UNICODEDATA is not set
+BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_UNICODEDATA=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_SQLITE is not set
 BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PYEXPAT=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_XZ is not set
diff --git a/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig b/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig
index c0f454371..d8e629582 100644
--- a/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig
+++ b/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig
@@ -1395,7 +1395,7 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_BZIP2=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_OSSAUDIODEV is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_READLINE is not set
 BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_SSL=y
-# BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_UNICODEDATA is not set
+BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_UNICODEDATA=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_SQLITE is not set
 BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PYEXPAT=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_XZ is not set
